# Curve estimates

The estimate for the number of rational points of a curve over a finite field
([stacks 03RQ](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03RQ)), deduced from the
abelian-variety statements of `WeilConjectures.Blueprint.AbelianVarieties` and the
Jacobian of `WeilConjectures.Blueprint.PicardFramework`. It is the input to proper base
change.

Blueprint block `sec-curve-estimates`.
